      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_013_picnic_01",
      "hash64": "686A77A477DFA3BC",
      "text": "嗨，從帕底亞來的同學！\\c\\n大叔我出於興趣正在\\n自己製作椅子，但……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
